  "interpolation": "linear-explicit",
  "notes": [
    "Flaps 8° only.",
    "Wind convention is signed runway component: tailwind negative, headwind positive.",
    "The AFM graphical wind correction already incorporates the regulatory 50% headwind and 150% tailwind treatment; do not pre-factor the runway wind component before this transform.",
    "Values were digitized from the graphical wind panel and rounded to the nearest 100 ft, consistent with the chart reading resolution.",
    "Zero-wind rows are explicit identity points.",
    "The upper-distance tailwind region leaves the published chart envelope; unavailable source nodes are intentionally absent and must fail closed.",
    "Bounded interpolation is permitted only when every required stored source corner exists; no extrapolation."
  ],
